//MCQ

::Combiner::
How many times a combiner will executes if there are 4 mappers and 2 reducers?{
    ~ It is going to execute 4 times
    ~ It is going to execute 2 times
    ~ It is going to execute 6 times
    = It may execute zero, one or more times. 
}



::Combiner::
Which of the following statement is false regarding combiner in hadoop?{
    ~ It is optional to use combiner for map-reduce task.
    ~ The number of combiners depends on the size of data.
    = Combiner doesn't do sorting and shuffling operations on the intermediate map output.
    ~ It reduces the time taken for data transfer over the network.
}



::Combiner::
Combiners works on the reduce side and not in map side.
{F}

